          "block_content": "初中地理知识点全面归纳.总结",
          "block_bbox": [
            652,
            501,
            1365,
            557
          ],
          "block_id": 1,
          "block_order": 1
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "一、生态问题",
          "block_bbox": [
            196,
            684,
            478,
            739
          ],
          "block_id": 2,
          "block_order": 2
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "1、水土流失问题",
          "block_bbox": [
            275,
            782,
            614,
            835
          ],
          "block_id": 3,
          "block_order": 3
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "我国典型地区：黄土高原、南方低山丘陵地区",
          "block_bbox": [
            308,
            875,
            1235,
            931
          ],
          "block_id": 4,
          "block_order": 4
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "产生的原因：",
          "block_bbox": [
            319,
            969,
            601,
            1021
          ],
          "block_id": 5,
          "block_order": 5
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(1)自然原因：季风气候降水集中，多暴雨；地表植被稀少，黄土土质疏松黄土高原。",
          "block_bbox": [
            354,
            1066,
            1943,
            1127
          ],
          "block_id": 6,
          "block_order": 6
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(2)人为原因：植被的破坏;不合理的耕作制度；开矿。",
          "block_bbox": [
            354,
            1162,
            1485,
            1220
          ],
          "block_id": 7,
          "block_order": 7
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "治理的措施：压缩农业用地，扩大林、草种植面积;植树造林;小流域综合治理。",
          "block_bbox": [
            308,
            1257,
            1901,
            1317
          ],
          "block_id": 8,
          "block_order": 8
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "治理的意义：有利于因地制宜地进行产业结构的调整，使农林牧副全面发展，可以增加农民收入，促进当地经济发展，改善农民生活条件，提高生活质量；有利于改善当地的生态环境，建立良性生态系统：建立生态农业模式，有利于促进生态和经济可持续发展。\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            197,
            1350,
            1969,
            1686
          ],
          "block_id": 9,
          "block_order": 9
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "2.荒漠化问题",
          "block_bbox": [
            211,
            1822,
            544,
            1876
          ],
          "block_id": 10,
          "block_order": 10
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "我国典型的地区：西北地区(新疆、青海、内蒙等地)",
          "block_bbox": [
            268,
            1918,
            1403,
            1977
          ],
          "block_id": 11,
          "block_order": 11
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "产生的原因：",
          "block_bbox": [
            276,
            2008,
            574,
            2061
          ],
          "block_id": 12,
          "block_order": 12
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(1)自然原因：全球变暖，蒸发旺盛；处于内陆地区，降水少；鼠害：蝗害。",
          "block_bbox": [
            328,
            2108,
            1855,
            2170
          ],
          "block_id": 13,
          "block_order": 13
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(2)人为原因：过度放牧：过度樵采;过度开垦：水资源的不合理利用;交通线等工程建设保护不当。\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            196,
            2205,
            1939,
            2354
          ],
          "block_id": 14,
          "block_order": 14
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "治理措施：",
          "block_bbox": [
            274,
            2392,
            560,
            2443
          ],
          "block_id": 15,
          "block_order": 15
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "制定草场保护的法律、法规，加强管理:控制载畜量:营造三北防护林建设；退耕还林、还牧；建设人工草场；推广轮牧：禁止采伐发菜等。",
          "block_bbox": [
            187,
            2486,
            1960,
            2646
          ],
          "block_id": 16,
          "block_order": 16
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "治理意义：",
          "block_bbox": [
            270,
            2675,
            530,
            2730
          ],
          "block_id": 17,
          "block_order": 17
        },
        {
          "block_label": "number",
